    <node id="Automated Literature Review Using NLP Techniques and LLM-Based Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
      <data key="d0">Automated Literature Review Using NLP Techniques and LLM-Based Retrieval-Augmented Generation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The research paper explores how to automate the process of generating literature reviews using NLP techniques and a large language model.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ce3e0842ccf55f97b27f1a977faaa67</data>
