      <data key="d0">Natural Language Processing (NLP) Strategies</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Natural Language Processing strategies are utilized in this research work for automatic generation of literature reviews.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ce3e0842ccf55f97b27f1a977faaa67</data>
