      <data key="d3">chunk-7e465c313730e93412238c5e48c4949a</data>
      <data key="d2">FAiD is a parameter-efficient fine-tuning method that progressively smooths the features of retrieved patches via multi-scale convolution operations and leverages them to augment the image generation process in AR-RAG.</data>
